tabolism,8,9 and reduction of fasting plasma glucose (FPG),8,10there is still a lack of sufficient research evidence to determine the optimal intervention strategy for each indicator due to the com- plexityanddiversityofCMFs.Moreo || A series ofstudieshave reportedthat bothFR dietand AE interventions alone can regulate CMF levels through the gut microbiota and its metabolites.11–15Dietary fiber serves as a substrate for intestinal flora, improving gut microbiotadiversityandrichness 11andleadingtothepro- ductionofshort-chainfattyacids(SCFAs).","Received:31July2024 Revised:13November2024 Accepted:22November2024 DOI:10.1002/mco2.70044 ORIGINAL ARTICLE Comparisonofdietandexerciseoncardiometabolicfactors inyoungadultswithoverweight/obesity:multiomics analysisandgutmicrobiotaprediction,arandomized controlledtrial ZongyuLin1,# TianzeLi1,# FenglianHuang1,# MiaoWu1 LeweiZhu1 YueqinZhou1 Ying-AnMing2 ZhijunLu1 WeiPeng1 FeiGao3 YannaZhu1,4,∗ 1DepartmentofMaternalandChild Health,SchoolofPublicHealth,Sun Yat-senUniversity,Guangzhou,China 2DepartmentofPhysicalEducation,Sun Yat-senUniversity,Guangzhou,China 3AgriculturalGenomicsInstituteat Shenzhen,ChineseAcademyof AgriculturalSciences,Shenzhen,China 4GuangdongProvincialKeyLaboratoryof Food,Nutr",ok,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
